  Expectation: A drone with an empty battery is down
    Given the batteries are on
    And the battery of the first Blue drone is 5 s
    And the first Blue drone is low in the mid lane
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the condition of the first Blue drone is down

  Expectation: A drone that is down is back at its base with a full battery 100 s later
    Overrides: A drone with an empty battery is down
    The drone is down for 100 s, and then it is on the ground at its base.

    Given the batteries are on
    And the battery of the first Blue drone is 5 s
    And the first Blue drone is low in the mid lane
    When the game runs for 110 seconds
    Then the condition of the first Blue drone is on the ground
    And the battery of the first Blue drone is 240 s

  Expectation: The map keeps the battery that a drone out of contact last reported
    Given the batteries are on
    And the Red home tower is held by Red
    And the battery of the first Blue drone is 100 s
    And the first Blue drone is low in the mid lane
    When the first Blue drone flies into the radio shadow for 10 seconds
    Then the battery of the first Blue drone on the Blue map is 100 s
